tools_confirm.description:
**Target ID:** {target}

**Model:** {model}

**Change:** ID {old_id} → {new_id}, {old_baud} → {new_baud} baud, {old_format} → {new_format}

If the target ID is 0 (broadcast), ALL devices on the bus receive the new settings.

After writing, the device is read with the new settings to verify the result. This may take several seconds.

